## Dependency model

Applications depend only on this generated package. It directly depends on
`flutter_api_bridge` and exposes the supported transport configuration and
runtime controls through its root library.

```text
Flutter application
  -> {{ lang.package.name }}
    -> flutter_api_bridge
      -> Dio + persistent cookies + secure auth + Hive cache + retries
```

```yaml
dependencies:
  {{ lang.package.name }}:
    path: pkg/api
```

The application does not need to add or import `flutter_api_bridge` itself.

### Bridge dependency

The fixture uses a generic sibling path while the bridge package is developed locally:

```yaml
flutter_api_bridge:
  path: ../flutter_api_bridge
```

A published template pack should replace this with the supported package version.

