## Start the user and cache session after login

The active session ID partitions cached data. Changing it clears the previous
active cache partition by default, preventing data from one account being shown
to another.

Cookie-backed login:

```dart
final login = await {{ project.name.pascal.o }}.instance
    .{{ project.meta.api_version_name.camel.o }}
    .auth
    .login(body: request);

if (login.isSuccess) {
  await {{ project.name.pascal.o }}.initializeUserSession(
    sessionId: login.dataOrNull!.user.id,
    metadata: <String, Object?>{
      'companyId': login.dataOrNull!.user.companyId,
    },
  );
}
```

Bearer-backed login:

```dart
await {{ project.name.pascal.o }}.initializeUserSession(
  sessionId: account.id,
  bearerToken: login.accessToken,
);
```

Manual authorization headers:

```dart
await {{ project.name.pascal.o }}.initializeUserSession(
  sessionId: account.id,
  authHeaders: <String, String>{
    'Authorization': 'Custom ${login.credential}',
  },
);
```

Persistent cookies are captured from all `Set-Cookie` responses and restored
before the first request after a process restart. Bearer credentials and manual
session headers use secure platform storage.

Token or cookie refresh endpoint orchestration remains application/generated
API logic. After a successful typed refresh call, initialize the same session
again with the replacement bearer token or headers when applicable.

## Per-request transport options

Every generated operation accepts `options`. Custom options remain intact and
the generated method adds its stable operation ID automatically.

```dart
final result = await {{ project.name.pascal.o }}.instance
    .{{ project.meta.api_version_name.camel.o }}
    .someResource
    .someOperation(
      options: const ApiGetRequestOptions(
        headers: <String, String>{'X-Tenant': 'company-7'},
        cookies: <String, String>{'preview': 'enabled'},
        cachePolicy: ApiCachePolicy.networkWithStaleFallback,
        cacheTtl: Duration(minutes: 15),
      ),
    );
```

Common controls include:

- custom headers and request-only cookie overrides;
- `noAuth`;
- cancellation;
- retry override and idempotency keys;
- cache tag/path invalidation;
- full active-session cache clearing.

GET controls include:

```dart
const ApiGetRequestOptions(cache: false);
const ApiGetRequestOptions(forceRefresh: true);
const ApiGetRequestOptions(cachePolicy: ApiCachePolicy.cacheOnly);
```

